m2: $ … ⇒ ∃ k (k ∊ i ∧ w ∊ fv (stg x B) k) $ by stgb_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , ord i , ∀ j (j ∊ i → fv (stg x B) j ⊆ c) , w ∊ stgb x B i , k ∊ i ∧ w ∊ fv (stg x B) k ⇒ k ∊ i ∧ w ∊ fv (stg x B) k $ by ax
m4: $ … ⇒ k ∊ i $ by and_elim_l [m3]
m5: $ … ⇒ w ∊ fv (stg x B) k $ by and_elim_r [m3]
m6: $ G , ord i , ∀ j (j ∊ i → fv (stg x B) j ⊆ c) , w ∊ stgb x B i , k ∊ i ∧ w ∊ fv (stg x B) k ⇒ ∀ j (j ∊ i → fv (stg x B) j ⊆ c) $ by ax
m7: $ … ⇒ k ∊ i → fv (stg x B) k ⊆ c $ by all_elim [m6]
m8: $ … ⇒ fv (stg x B) k ⊆ c $ by imp_elim [m7, m4]
m9: $ … ⇒ w ∊ c $ by subset_elim [m8, m5]
m10: $ … ⇒ w ∊ c $ by ex_elim [m2, m9]
m11: $ … ⇒ stgb x B i ⊆ c $ by subset_intro [m10]
m12: $ G , ord i , ∀ j (j ∊ i → fv (stg x B) j ⊆ c) ⇒ ord i $ by ax
m13: $ … ⇒ isset (stgb x B i) $ by stgb_set [m12]
m14: $ G , ord i , ∀ j (j ∊ i → fv (stg x B) j ⊆ c) ⇒ isset c $ by isset_var
m15: $ G , ord i , ∀ j (j ∊ i → fv (stg x B) j ⊆ c) ⇒ mono x B $ by weaken [#1]
