m20: $ … ⇒ fv (stg x B) i = cap x B (stgb x B i) $ by stg_eq [m19, m12]
m21: $ … ⇒ cap x B (stgb x B i) = fv (stg x B) i $ by eq_sym [m20]
m22: $ … ⇒ fv (stg x B) i ⊆ c $ by subset_eq_l [m21, m18]
m23: $ … ⇒ ∀ i (ord i → fv (stg x B) i ⊆ c) $ by ord_ind_f [m22]
m24: $ … ⇒ ord a → fv (stg x B) a ⊆ c $ by all_elim [m23]
m25: $ … ⇒ fv (stg x B) a ⊆ c $ by imp_elim [m24, #4]

