l9: $ … ⇒ z ∊ lfp x B $ by ex_elim [l2, l8]
l10: $ … ⇒ stgb x B a ⊆ lfp x B $ by subset_intro [l9]

lfp_bounded
-----------
l1: $ G , z ∊ lfp x B ⇒ z ∊ lfp x B $ by ax
